    <string-array name="home_tips">
        <item>Tap the word you typed on the suggestion strip and the keyboard learns it right away.</item>
        <item>If autocorrect gets it wrong, press Backspace at once: your word comes back and is learned.</item>
        <item>Long-press any suggested word to boost it or remove it from the dictionary.</item>
        <item>Type a short shortcut; its full phrase appears on the suggestion strip.</item>
        <item>Swipe left or right on the space bar to switch language.</item>
    </string-array>
